{"id":"steam-586290","steam":586290,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Crimson Crisis","summary":"A fast-paced action roguelike where skill beats firepower. Outmaneuver swarms, harness Poison/Inflame/Traumatize, and expand the game with mods & co-op.","about":"n Crimson Crisis, your weapons aren’t enough — to survive the swarm, you’ll need to twist, weave, and outmaneuver overwhelming hordes with pure skill. Every run throws you into escalating crises where enemies grow faster, deadlier, and more relentless than your firepower can handle. Success isn’t about how big your guns are — it’s about how well you control the chaos.\nBattle through distinct warzones, each with its own enemies, hazards, and escalating crises. Adapt your tactics as swarms shift their patterns, forcing you to control not just your weapons, but the flow of the battlefield itself. Your arsenal inflicts powerful status effects — Poison, Inflame, and Traumatize — to weaken and disrupt enemies, buying precious moments to reposition and survive. With roguelike runs, randomized upgrades, and escalating intensity, no two crises ever unfold the same — but in every run, survival comes down to skillful movement.\nKey Features\n\n• \nSkill Over Firepower – Survive not by bigger guns, but by twisting, weaving, and outmaneuvering overwhelming swarms.\n• \nWeapon Status System – Inflict Poison, Inflame, and Traumatize to weaken, disrupt, and control the horde while you reposition.\n• \nDistinct Warzones – Each crisis throws you into a unique battlefield with its own enemies, hazards, and escalating challenges.\n• \nAdaptive Swarms – Enemies shift patterns and behaviors, forcing you to manage the flow of the battlefield, not just your aim.\n• \nRoguelike Replayability – Randomized upgrades, escalating intensity, and unique run-to-run challenges keep every crisis unpredictable.\n• \nClimactic Survival Moments – Every escape is earned by mastery, delivering that heart-pounding “one more run” feeling.\n• \nDrop-In / Drop-Out Couch Co-Op – Survive the crisis with a friend — join or leave runs instantly without breaking the action.\n• \nModding Support – Expand the crisis with community-made content, from new enemies and regions to custom upgrades and rules.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/library_600x900.jpg?t=1768243807","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/header.jpg?t=1768243807","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/library_hero.jpg?t=1768243807","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/header.jpg?t=1768243807","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_0b338137275feeccd307b6b5764ecbf4fbe18fc7.600x338.jpg?t=1768243807","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_0b338137275feeccd307b6b5764ecbf4fbe18fc7.jpg?t=1768243807"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_d369d39bc6feb0fff8c977a20842fcfd5ba69e48.600x338.jpg?t=1768243807","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_d369d39bc6feb0fff8c977a20842fcfd5ba69e48.jpg?t=1768243807"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_c1791e65203902100faa7eb83a91a06a95dfb76f.600x338.jpg?t=1768243807","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_c1791e65203902100faa7eb83a91a06a95dfb76f.jpg?t=1768243807"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_05bce6176f2c63e5c632edcda07ca7970dfe79af.600x338.jpg?t=1768243807","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/586290/ss_05bce6176f2c63e5c632edcda07ca7970dfe79af.jpg?t=1768243807"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset